# CODEOWNERS — Agent Squad (Arthemis)
# PR approval rules by path
# Security paths — required reviewer: security-reviewer (arthemis@)
# see: agents/_shared/OPERATING_CONTRACT.md §"Quem aprova o quê"

# Default: all files require code-reviewer (arthemis@)
*   @arthemis/code-reviewer

# Security-sensitive paths require dual sign-off: security-reviewer (arthemis@) + offensive-cyber-operator (cyber_red@)
auth/         @arthemis/security-reviewer @arthemis/offensive-cyber-operator
crypto/       @arthemis/security-reviewer @arthemis/offensive-cyber-operator
iac/          @arthemis/security-reviewer @arthemis/offensive-cyber-operator
**/*.tf       @arthemis/security-reviewer
**/Dockerfile @arthemis/security-reviewer
**/*.env      @arthemis/security-reviewer
**/*.key      @arthemis/security-reviewer
**/secrets.* @arthemis/security-reviewer

# Infrastructure and cloud — cloud-architect + devops-release-engineer
iac/terraform/ @arthemis/cloud-architect @arthemis/devops-release-engineer
**/kubernetes/  @arthemis/cloud-architect @arthemis/devops-release-engineer
**/aks/        @arthemis/cloud-architect @arthemis/devops-release-engineer

# Test and acceptance — qa-engineer required
tests/bdd/     @arthemis/qa-engineer
tests/acceptance/ @arthemis/qa-engineer
specs/         @arthemis/qa-engineer

# Performance-critical paths — performance-engineer required
**/perf-*      @arthemis/performance-engineer
**/hotpath/*   @arthemis/performance-engineer
**/queries/*   @arthemis/performance-engineer
**/indexes/*   @arthemis/performance-engineer

# CI/CD pipelines — devops-release-engineer required
.github/workflows/ @arthemis/devops-release-engineer
**/azure-pipelines.yml @arthemis/devops-release-engineer
**/Jenkinsfile     @arthemis/devops-release-engineer

# Architecture decisions — solution-architect required
**/adr/*     @arthemis/solution-architect
docs/architecture/ @arthemis/solution-architect

# Scripts and automation — delivery-orchestrator owner
scripts/      @arthemis/delivery-orchestrator
scripts/tests/ @arthemis/qa-engineer

# Config, contracts, and schemas — governance-auditor
config/      @arthemis/governance-auditor
contracts/   @arthemis/governance-auditor
**/*.schema.json @arthemis/governance-auditor
